      "text": "[8:15p.m.] #Ejigbo #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is quite slow from Pako to Jakande, but better from Jakande to Pako.\n\nTraffic is good from NNPC to Iyana Ejigbo, Powerline, Cele-Egbe, Ile-Iwe and Synagogue.\n\nSlow from Ikotun to Oju-Odo and back due to commercial activities.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
      "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
      "retweetCount": 2,
      "replyCount": 0,
      "likeCount": 3,
